    "tpb_seq": 1,
    "tpb_book": "<div>\n<ol>\n\t<li style=\"margin-right:-7px\"><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"> 東京碎片，日本製造：東京廣告人的潮流觀察筆記</span></li>\n\t<li style=\"margin-right:-7px\"><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"> 廖秀年，Fashion Week台上台下：從搶秀票到After Party，時尚產業哇聲幕後的商機與心機</span></li>\n\t<li style=\"margin-right:-7px\"><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"> 凱莉布萊克曼，時尚百年風華</span></li>\n\t<li style=\"margin-right:-7px\"><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"> 傑瑞米蘭米德，The Mr Porter Paperback紳士的風格：來自經典英倫時尚指標的風格養成指南，樂於身為男人，活出不煩氣派</span></li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n",
    "tpb_book_en": "Self-made course materials"
