  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 2.0,
    "cls_id": "XC05111",
    "sub_id": "GM732",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>出缺席 30 %</div>\n\n<div>課程在乎同學們的出缺席紀錄，課程將隨機於課程教授過程當中進行點名，請假請遵循學校之請假程序，口頭請假皆不批准</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>期中期末報告</div>\n\n<div>請同學準備原創之報告內容，所有報告規定及相關內容將於課程授課初期進行介紹，也會同時同步公布在Ilearn供同學參考</div>\n\n<div>評分原則根據課程規定及內容進行相對應的評分</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>作業</div>\n\n<div>課程不定期會交付同學作業，勿抄襲、勿遲交、勿偷懶為最高原則</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": "<div>Out of absence 30 %<br />\nThe course cares about the attendance and absence records of the students. The course will be randomly called during the course teaching process. Please follow the school&#39;s leave application procedures for leave. Oral leave will not be approved.<br />\nMid-term and end-of-term report<br />\nStudents are requested to prepare original report content. All report regulations and related content will be introduced at the beginning of the course, and will be published on Ilearn simultaneously for students&#39; reference<br />\nScoring principles Corresponding grading is carried out according to the course regulations and content<br />\nOperation<br />\nClasses will be handed over to classmates from time to time. Do not plagiarize, do not submit late, and do not be lazy as the highest principle</div>\n",
    "course_pol": "以下為課堂規則，也請同學遵守\n１．切勿穿著拖鞋到課到校\n２．請自在地與同學教授討論及發表你的看法和言論\n３．請與同組組員每週坐在一起\n４．課程有同組討論的機會，請利用時間好好的討論交流，並且勇敢地提出想法\n５．在教室切勿飲食\n６．當一個成熟自在不守舊的大人",
    "course_pol_en": "The following are the classroom rules, please follow the rules\n1. Do not wear slippers to class and school\n2. Please feel free to discuss and express your views and opinions with your classmates and professors\n3. Please sit with your group members every week\n4. The course has the opportunity to discuss with the same group, please use the time to discuss and exchange ideas, and bravely put forward ideas\n5. Do not eat or drink in the classroom\n6. Be a mature and unconventional adult",
    "course_rem": "課程將會把重點內容放置於ilearn上供同學需要時參閱",
    "course_rem_en": "The course will place the key content on ilearn for students to refer to when they need it",
    "ais_meno": "<div>學術誠信是大學高等教育裡頭非常重要的中心思想</div>\n\n<div>唯有保有相對應的誠信原則，才能確保同學在尋找人生的道路上能安穩的向前前進</div>\n\n<div>因此希望同學在修課的過程中能夠時時刻刻保有一下幾項誠信</div>\n\n<div>請同學務必避免發生</div>\n\n<div>１．作弊之情事</div>\n\n<div>２．抄襲之情事</div>\n\n<div>３．偽造之情事</div>\n\n<div>４．竄改之情事</div>\n\n<div>５．破壞之情事</div>\n\n<div>若發現有以上之情事於課堂中發生，將對情節內容做相對應的處置</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>Academic integrity is a very important central idea in university higher education<br />\nOnly by maintaining the corresponding principles of integrity can we ensure that students can move forward steadily on the road of finding life<br />\nTherefore, I hope that students can keep a few integrity points at all times in the process of taking courses.<br />\nStudents please avoid<br />\n1.Cheating affair<br />\n2. Plagiarism<br />\n3. Forgery<br />\n4. Tampering affair<br />\n5. Sabotage affair<br />\nIf any of the above situations are found to have occurred in the classroom, the content of the plot will be dealt with accordingly</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": null
  },
